  "title": "Qt: Avoid clipping the text label field in progressFrame",
  "description": "On macOS, when the progressFrame is shown in a dialog, the letter \"g\" in\nthe text label \"Loading\" is clipped on the right and not fully displayed.\n\nSet the QFrame's layoutSizeConstraint to SetMinimumSize from\nSetDefaultConstraint to resolve truncating the text label.",
